    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/0f98542c1f55ee0bf8f78730c6dc6d68.avif?t=1754840198\" data-has-big width=800 height=328 /></span>A Finnish solo project by Magnus R.<br>    <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/6905fe96a48596ff3d69c294260eb907.poster.avif?t=1754840198\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/6905fe96a48596ff3d69c294260eb907.webm?t=1754840198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/6905fe96a48596ff3d69c294260eb907.mp4?t=1754840198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are SPIRIT, a fisherman with a mysterious origin who is stranded at an underwater research facility. The entity known as GEHIRN is calling you to venture deeper into the depths of the ominous megastructure, where your true purpose lies within...<br><br>Welcome to the BAIONLENJA corporation.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   Discover and fight failed experiments and cosmic horrors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find secrets, hidden areas, weapons and upgrades using your movement skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on harder versions of levels in the challenge courses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the story behind GEHIRN, the living fossil.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AIRSTRAFING and ROCKETJUMPING skills from other games will make you feel at home. Or if you're new, this will be your gateway to learning these skills.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/6e6a6bade21aaadc654d9200eb84597f.avif?t=1754840198\" data-has-big width=800 height=326 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/0f98542c1f55ee0bf8f78730c6dc6d68.avif?t=1754840198\" data-has-big width=800 height=328 /></span>A Finnish solo project by Magnus R.<br>    <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/6905fe96a48596ff3d69c294260eb907.poster.avif?t=1754840198\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/6905fe96a48596ff3d69c294260eb907.webm?t=1754840198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/6905fe96a48596ff3d69c294260eb907.mp4?t=1754840198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are SPIRIT, a fisherman with a mysterious origin who is stranded at an underwater research facility. The entity known as GEHIRN is calling you to venture deeper into the depths of the ominous megastructure, where your true purpose lies within...<br><br>Welcome to the BAIONLENJA corporation.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   Discover and fight failed experiments and cosmic horrors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find secrets, hidden areas, weapons and upgrades using your movement skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on harder versions of levels in the challenge courses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the story behind GEHIRN, the living fossil.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AIRSTRAFING and ROCKETJUMPING skills from other games will make you feel at home. Or if you're new, this will be your gateway to learning these skills.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/6e6a6bade21aaadc654d9200eb84597f.avif?t=1754840198\" data-has-big width=800 height=326 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
